B.avf=s(["You may view and use the platform for lawful personal, professional, research, and journalistic purposes. You may not systematically scrape, crawl, harvest, mirror, reproduce, resell, or bulk-download platform data or content without prior written permission. You may not bypass rate limits, access controls, attribution requirements, or technical measures."],t.s)
B.atG=s(["Do not use automated tools to copy tracker records, images, profiles, or articles at scale.","Do not use platform data to create a competing database or service without permission.","We may suspend access, block automated traffic, or pursue lawful remedies for abuse."],t.s)
